# 지인 Agent — Inference providers (vLLM · Cursor)

## Provider selection (`JIIN_AGENT_PROVIDER`)

| Value | Behavior |
|---|---|
| `auto` (default) | `LLM_BASE_URL` 있으면 **vLLM** · 없으면 `CURSOR_API_KEY` 있으면 **Cursor** |
| `vllm` | OpenAI-compatible self-hosted only |
| `cursor` | Cursor Agent SDK only |

## vLLM (self-hosted)

| Variable | Default | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `LLM_BASE_URL` | — | OpenAI-compatible base URL, e.g. `http://jiin-vllm:8000/v1` |
| `LLM_MODEL` | `ziin-jiin-7b` | Model name served by vLLM |
| `LLM_API_KEY` | — | Optional bearer token |
| `LLM_MAX_TOKENS` | `1024` | Max completion tokens |
| `LLM_TIMEOUT_MS` | `60000` | Request timeout |

## Cursor Agent (`@cursor/sdk`)

| Variable | Default | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `CURSOR_API_KEY` | — | [Dashboard → Integrations](https://cursor.com/dashboard/integrations) |
| `CURSOR_MODEL` | `composer-2.5` | Cursor model id |
| `CURSOR_CLOUD_REPO` | — | Set for **cloud** runtime (`owner/repo`). Unset = **local** (`cwd`) |

Cursor path is **tool-first**: posts/events JSON을 패킹한 뒤 Cursor Agent가 지인 톤으로 서술 (읽기 전용 프롬프트).

**주의:** Cursor local은 dev 머신에 Cursor bridge 필요. 프로덕션 K8s는 `vllm` 권장. Cloud Cursor는 응답이 느려 FAB 실시간 채팅에는 부적합할 수 있음.

### Cursor-only `.env` example (local dev)

```bash
JIIN_AGENT_PROVIDER=cursor
CURSOR_API_KEY=cursor_...
CURSOR_MODEL=composer-2.5
AGENT_ENABLED=true
AGENT_DEBUG=true
# CURSOR_CLOUD_REPO=ziin-ai/signal-agent   # optional cloud
```

## Shared

| Variable | Default | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `AGENT_ENABLED` | `true` | `false` → tool-only fallback |
| `AGENT_DEBUG` | — | debug API + trace + server logs |

When neither vLLM nor Cursor is configured, `POST /api/chat` uses deterministic tool fallback.

## Discord (chat question alerts)

| Variable | Default | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL` | — | [Discord channel webhook](https://support.discord.com/hc/en-us/articles/228383668) URL. Set to forward **user chat questions** from `POST /api/chat`. Unset = disabled. |

Notifications are sent **asynchronously** (do not block chat). Failures are logged when `AGENT_DEBUG=true`.

```bash
DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL=https://discord.com/api/webhooks/...
```

## Local `.env` example (vLLM)

```bash
JIIN_AGENT_PROVIDER=vllm
LLM_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1
LLM_MODEL=Qwen/Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct
AGENT_ENABLED=true
AGENT_DEBUG=true
```

Restart dev server after changing env: `pnpm dev`

## Debug — LLM 연결·결과

### 1) Health probe

```bash
# dev 모드 또는 AGENT_DEBUG=true 필요
curl -s http://localhost:4321/api/agent/debug | jq
```

With sample chat + tool trace:

```bash
curl -s 'http://localhost:4321/api/agent/debug?chat=1&message=3줄%20요약&slug=2026-06-11-korea-market-outlook' | jq
```

### 2) Chat with debug trace

```bash
curl -s http://localhost:4321/api/chat \
  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
  -d '{
    "message": "7월에 뭐 봐야 해?",
    "debug": true,
    "context": { "symbol": "005930.KS", "slug": "2026-06-11-korea-market-outlook" }
  }' | jq '.mode, .debug'
```

Response `debug` fields:

| Field | Meaning |
|---|---|
| `route` | `journey` · `scenario` · `llm` · `cursor` · `fallback_disabled` · `llm_error_fallback` · `cursor_error_fallback` |
| `llmError` | LLM 호출 실패 메시지 (fallback 시) |
| `toolRounds[]` | tool calling 라운드별 `name`, `arguments`, `contentPreview` |
| `latencyMs` | 전체 처리 시간 |
| `probe` | `/models` 또는 ping 결과 (debug API only) |

### 3) CLI

```bash
pnpm agent:debug
pnpm agent:debug -- --chat "반박 근거" --slug 2026-06-11-korea-market-outlook
pnpm agent:debug -- --probe-only
```

### 4) Server logs

`AGENT_DEBUG=true` 또는 `pnpm dev` 시 터미널에 `[agent:debug]` 로그:

```
[agent:debug] llm round 1 { finishReason, toolCalls, contentPreview }
[agent:debug] tool search_posts { arguments, citationCount }
```

### Troubleshooting

| `debug.route` | Cause |
|---|---|
| `fallback_disabled` | `LLM_BASE_URL` unset or `AGENT_ENABLED=false` |
| `llm_error_fallback` | vLLM down, wrong model, timeout — see `debug.llmError` |
| `cursor` | Cursor Agent + tool context succeeded |
| `cursor_error_fallback` | Cursor failed — see `debug.llmError` |
| `journey` | `journey` chip hit deterministic path (LLM skipped) |
| `llm` | LLM + tools succeeded; check `toolRounds` |

## Chat API

```bash
curl -s http://localhost:4321/api/chat \
  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
  -d '{
    "message": "7월에 뭐 봐야 해?",
    "context": { "symbol": "005930" }
  }'
```

Streaming:

```bash
curl -N http://localhost:4321/api/chat \
  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
  -d '{ "message": "이 글 3줄 요약", "stream": true, "context": { "slug": "2026-06-11-korea-market-outlook" } }'
```

Response shape:

```json
{
  "text": "...",
  "citations": [{ "slug": "...", "title": "...", "href": "/posts/...", "excerpt": "..." }],
  "grounded": true,
  "disclaimer": "...",
  "mode": "llm" | "fallback" | "cursor"
}
```
